// niimbot — media catalog
//
// A starting set of common roll sizes. Matched by RFID barcode
// (`skus`) first, then by size.
//
// Fields:
//
//   key            unique UPPER_SNAKE key
//   id, name, widthMm, heightMm?, type, category?   contracts MediaDescriptor
//   targetModels   chassis-family tags matched against a device's
//                  `mediaCompatibility`: niimbot-d-series,
//                  niimbot-b-series, niimbot-b-pro-series
//   labelTypeId    niimbluelib LabelType: 1=WithGaps, 2=Black,
//                  3=Continuous, 4=Perforated, 5=Transparent,
//                  10=BlackMarkGap
//   palette?       inks for multi-colour stock
//   skus?          RFID barcodes
